	abstract = {Integrating AI technology into the metaverse allows healthcare systems to become smarter by developing enhanced patient involvement and delivering personalized treatments, along with delivering effective care services. The next section explores multiple strong samples of practical implementations demonstrating how modern technology benefits healthcare systems in actual medical centers. The chapter demonstrates how AI-based metaverse solutions transformed patient care by changing healthcare interactions while optimizing clinical activities, together with enhancing healthcare results. Each case demonstrates its unique healthcare application, like therapeutic VR spaces for treatment procedures, as well as predictive AI algorithms in medical patient care and comprehensive training programs for healthcare providers through simulation. The chapter examines successful implementations through analysis to reveal the main success elements that rely on stakeholder involvement and design elements for users, together with strong data governance systems. The analysis examines the implementation problems that faced the program because of technical obstacles and regulatory issues, together with the necessary extensive multi-disciplinary professional skills. The solution requires specific abilities to adjust and grow along with the healthcare industry’s requirements. Research confirms that AI-powered metaverse solutions will strengthen operational effectiveness and deliver complete patient care methods while linking all healthcare aspects together. These case studies create a pathway by eliminating digital innovation gaps with healthcare practices, which helps health organizations to accept metaverse solutions as essential strategic components. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2026.},
